<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Krka says 1996 net up 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Krka says 1996 net up 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian drug making group Krka said on Friday 1996 net profit rose to 3.1 billion tolars ($19.8 million) from 2.9 billion in 1995 due to a reduction in costs and higher sales.</p>
<p>Sales rose to $310 million from $294 million last year. The increase was slightly lower than the initial forecast of $313 million.</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
